OL,3,GNEWSAFamily say hospital corridor care
OL,4,Awas 'horrendous'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It felt like we were in some kind of
OL,7,Fprisoner of war system, it was just
OL,8,Fhorrendous."
OL,10,FPatients and families have described
OL,11,Fwaiting hours in corridors, a lack of
OL,12,Fprivacy and exhausted staff at the
OL,13,FQueen's Medical Centre's (QMC)
OL,14,Femergency department in Nottingham.
OL,16,FA new inspection by the Care Quality
OL,17,FCommission (CQC), published on Friday,
OL,18,Ffound pressures in A&E were affecting
OL,19,Fpatient monitoring, privacy and
OL,20,Fdignity.
