OL,3,GNEWSAFamily say hospital corridor care
OL,4,Awas 'horrendous'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong those affected was Carrie Frost,
OL,7,Fwho said her 84-year-old father Peter
OL,8,FFrost waited more than 17 hours for
OL,9,Ftreatment after a fall, before the
OL,10,Ffamily was told - in a public corridor
OL,11,F- that he had a brain tumour.
